00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.460
And Pterodactyl, that's my cat's name.

220
00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:19.080
She was not satisfied.

221
00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.180
She just looked at me like, I don't get paid enough for this.

