224
00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:32.220
I thought, I should make a list of everything I want to hear before I go deaf.

225
00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:33.440
In case I go deaf.

226
00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.500
Like a playlist, bucket list, right?

227
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.000
Like, and yeah, I probably can't afford to go to the Amazon rainforest right now, but

228
00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.220
I could leave the window open when it rains.

229
00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:48.040
And like, I didn't want the last thing I heard to be like a spam call or like myself repeating

