656
00:36:03.980 --> 00:36:05.180
For more about our podcast,

657
00:36:05.480 --> 00:36:07.060
information on pitching your own story,

658
00:36:07.160 --> 00:36:08.000
and everything else,

659
00:36:08.120 --> 00:36:09.080
go to our website,

660
00:36:09.360 --> 00:36:10.380
themoth.org.

661
00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:23.160
I loved all the stories.

662
00:36:23.500 --> 00:36:23.880
I know.

663
00:36:24.220 --> 00:36:26.100
I thought they were all so thought-provoking.

664
00:36:26.260 --> 00:36:28.120
I mean, they're really great storytellers.

665
00:36:28.320 --> 00:36:31.200
Yeah, I love, as you know,

666
00:36:31.280 --> 00:36:32.100
getting to know people.

667
00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:34.280
And I felt like this podcast

668
00:36:34.280 --> 00:36:36.800
was just like a window into people's lives.

669
00:36:36.800 --> 00:36:38.520
I absolutely love it.

670
00:36:38.940 --> 00:36:40.940
Well, when I was listening to that first story

671
00:36:40.940 --> 00:36:42.000
about the young woman

672
00:36:42.000 --> 00:36:43.380
who's losing her hearing,

673
00:36:43.540 --> 00:36:45.520
remember when I was talking about that book,

674
00:36:45.620 --> 00:36:46.420
The Correspondent?

675
00:36:46.540 --> 00:36:46.700
Yeah.

676
00:36:46.920 --> 00:36:47.720
In that book,

677
00:36:47.860 --> 00:36:50.740
the main woman is slowly going blind.

678
00:36:50.980 --> 00:36:51.460
Oh.

679
00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:53.380
And she talks all about the things

680
00:36:53.380 --> 00:36:54.400
that she wants to see

681
00:36:54.400 --> 00:36:55.900
before she can't see anymore.

682
00:36:56.040 --> 00:36:57.640
So it was really interesting to me

683
00:36:57.640 --> 00:36:58.960
to then hear this story

684
00:36:58.960 --> 00:37:01.640
about someone who wants to hear

685
00:37:01.640 --> 00:37:03.680
all the things that you want to hear

686
00:37:03.680 --> 00:37:04.980
before you lose your hearing.

687
00:37:06.960 --> 00:37:07.920
And, you know,

688
00:37:08.120 --> 00:37:09.320
as we're getting older

689
00:37:09.860 --> 00:37:11.600
and after all my health stuff

690
00:37:11.600 --> 00:37:12.400
in recent years,

691
00:37:12.960 --> 00:37:14.740
I'm very aware of the things

692
00:37:14.740 --> 00:37:17.020
that I want to do in my life.

693
00:37:17.840 --> 00:37:19.960
And like that gal in the story,

694
00:37:20.520 --> 00:37:21.500
I know, lady,

695
00:37:21.640 --> 00:37:22.760
you will be right by my side

696
00:37:22.760 --> 00:37:24.700
making sure I check everything off my liSt.

697
00:37:24.900 --> 00:37:26.000
I absolutely will.

698
00:37:26.080 --> 00:37:26.560
I know it.

699
00:37:26.740 --> 00:37:27.960
And I know there's going to be times

700
00:37:27.960 --> 00:37:29.100
where there are things

701
00:37:29.100 --> 00:37:30.380
that you're going to want to do

702
00:37:30.380 --> 00:37:32.440
that aren't with me

703
00:37:32.440 --> 00:37:34.260
because that's the nature of life.

704
00:37:34.260 --> 00:37:35.460
If there's going to be

705
00:37:35.460 --> 00:37:36.700
some things on your list

706
00:37:36.700 --> 00:37:37.660
that are with Lee

707
00:37:37.660 --> 00:37:39.020
or with your kids

708
00:37:39.020 --> 00:37:39.840
or with your mom,

709
00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:40.440
your sister,

710
00:37:40.660 --> 00:37:41.560
your friends from home

711
00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:44.000
or just a solo adventure, right?

712
00:37:44.240 --> 00:37:45.300
But you will make sure

713
00:37:45.300 --> 00:37:46.580
I get all those things done.

714
00:37:46.780 --> 00:37:46.900
I will make sure

715
00:37:46.900 --> 00:37:49.160
and then I want to hear all about it.

716
00:37:49.240 --> 00:37:49.540
I know.

717
00:37:49.680 --> 00:37:50.680
I want every detail.

718
00:37:51.320 --> 00:37:53.680
Well, I loved this episode of The Moth.

719
00:37:53.840 --> 00:37:55.220
I love the stories as well.

720
00:37:55.880 --> 00:37:57.980
But wow, Matthew and Benji

721
00:37:57.980 --> 00:37:58.960
really got me

722
00:37:58.960 --> 00:38:01.620
bonding over that Gummy Bears theme song.

723
00:38:01.740 --> 00:38:02.180
Come on.

724
00:38:02.180 --> 00:38:04.500
And then there was something Matthew said

725
00:38:04.500 --> 00:38:05.840
that I just thought was beautiful

726
00:38:05.840 --> 00:38:07.880
when he said he was reminded

727
00:38:07.880 --> 00:38:09.820
of how little it takes

728
